Package: lfa-ai-workstation
Version: 1.0.0
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: LFA Interiors and Construction LLC <lorenzo@lfabuild.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/lfainteriorsandconstructionllc-web/lfa-ai-workstation
Depends: systemd-zram-generator, systemd-oomd, python3, python3-pyqt6, curl, git, ca-certificates, qt6-image-formats-plugins
Recommends: konsole, dolphin, plasma-desktop
Description: LFA AI Workstation — Multi-Agent Optimization & KDE Plasma 6 Theme Suite
 Optimizes Ubuntu / Kubuntu 26.04 LTS for running multiple cloud AI coding
 agents, IDEs, MCP servers, and parallel builds simultaneously.
 .
 Includes:
  - ZRAM (zstd, up to 16 GB) + systemd-oomd anti-freeze protection
  - High inotify / vm.max_map_count limits & TCP BBR congestion control
  - Balanced Gradle & Cargo worker limits in /etc/skel
  - LFA Dorado 1.3 (Global Theme, Plasma Style, Icons, Colors, Window Deco)
  - LFA Living Landscapes 0.6.4 (Plasma 6 dynamic weather wallpaper)
  - LFA AI Setup graphical first-run assistant for official third-party AI tools
